# ---------------------------------------------------------- game-derived files
# refs/ holds reference assemblies generated from the installed game by
# tools/make-refs.sh. They contain no method bodies, but they are still a
# mechanical derivative of Videocult's copyrighted code and there is no licence
# that lets anyone redistribute them.
#
# NEVER commit this directory to a public repository. If you want CI to compile,
# push it to a PRIVATE repo instead - see docs/RELEASING.md.
